      "trace_id": "e0eac71606f5773b0648ee06dc03c81f",
      "output": {
        "question": "Who are the top 10 most important characters?",
        "answer": "The provided passages do not contain sufficient information to identify the top 10 most important characters of Stieg Larsson's Millennium trilogy. The texts mention several individuals, such as Lisbeth Salander, Mikael Blomkvist, Evert Gullberg, Zalachenko, Agneta Sofia Salander, Camilla Salander, James Jesus Angleton, Björck, Kalle Blomkvist, Erika Berger, Dragan Armansky, and Detective Inspector Bublanski [E1], [E2], [E3], [E4], [E5], [E6], [E7], [E8], [E9], [E10]. However, the passages do not rank these characters by importance or provide a comprehensive list of the top 10 most important characters in the trilogy.",
        "citations": [
